  - "<align=center><size=150%><color=#FF6B5C>\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3067\u306E\u3042\u305D\u3073\u304B\u305F</color></size></align>\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>\u307E\u3093\u306A\u304B\u306E\u30AD\u30CE\u30B3\u306E\u4E0A\u306E\u3075\u308F\u3075\u308F\u3092\n<pos=1.1em>\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3067\u5439\u3044\u3066\u3042\u305D\u307C\u3046\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>\u8AB0\u304B\u304C\u5439\u3044\u305F\u3075\u308F\u3075\u308F\u306F\n<pos=1.1em>\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u753B\u9762\u3067\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u52D5\u304F\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>\u5E8A\u306B\u843D\u3061\u305F\u3089\u3071\u3061\u3093\u3068\u5F3E\u3051\u3066\n<pos=1.1em>\u30AD\u30CE\u30B3\u306E\u4E0A\u306B\u623B\u308B\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>\u30A8\u30A2\u30AC\u30F3\u3092\u624B\u5143\u306B\u547C\u3076\uFF1APC\u306FE\u30AD\u30FC\n<pos=1.1em>VR\u306F\u53F3\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u4E0B\u306B\u5012\u3057\u7D9A\u3051\u308B\n<pos=1.1em>\u53F0\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3059\u308B\u3068\u53F0\u306E\u4E0A\u306B\u547C\u3073\u5BC4\u305B\u308B\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>\u6483\u3064\u3068\u7A7A\u6C17\u30B2\u30FC\u30B8\u304C\u6E1B\u308B\uFF08\u7A7A\u3060\u3068\u6483\u3066\u306A\u3044\uFF09\n<pos=1.1em>\u6483\u305F\u305A\u306B\u3044\u308B\u304B\u3001\u9577\u62BC\u3057\u3067\u6E9C\u3081\u308B\u3068\u56DE\u5FA9"
  - "\u5DE5\u4E8B\u4E2D\uFF01"
  - "\u30B3\u30FC\u30B95\n<size=60%>\u304D\u306E\u3053\u306E\u305F\u306B</size>"
  - "\u30ED\u30D3\u30FC\u306B\u3082\u3069\u308B"
  - "\u30A8\u30A2\u30AC\u30F3\n<size=60%>\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3067\u547C\u3076</size>"
  - "\u30ED\u30D3\u30FC\u306B\u3082\u3069\u308B"
  - "\u30B3\u30FC\u30B90\n<size=60%>\u308C\u3093\u3057\u3085\u3046</size>"
  en:
  - 'Course 4

    <size=60%>Monster Den</size>'
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'FLUFF

    <size=32%><color=#7A6A8A>Fluffy Delivery</color></size>'
  - Back to Lobby
  - Back to Lobby
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'Course 2

    <size=60%>Rock Road</size>'
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - 'Course 3

    <size=60%>Dark Forest</size>'
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - Back to Lobby
  - Back to Lobby
  - Blow it to the goal!
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - Practice
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - "<align=center><size=150%><color=#FF6B5C>How to Play</color></size></align>\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Grab
    the air gun from the stand\n<pos=1.1em>VR: grab it, shoot with the trigger\n<pos=1.1em>PC:
    click to pick up, left-click to shoot\n<pos=1.1em>Hold to charge, release to
    fire\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Summon your
    air gun: E key (PC)\n<pos=1.1em>or hold the right stick down (VR)\n<pos=1.1em>Click
    a stand to call it onto the stand\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Each
    shot uses air (empty = can't shoot)\n<pos=1.1em>Wait or hold to charge to refill\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>First,
    shoot the start mushroom\n<pos=1.1em>to release the fluff\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Blow
    the fluff to the goal with wind\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Fluff
    touching the floor or spikes is out\n<pos=1.1em>\u2192 Restart from the last
    checkpoint\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Monsters
    will knock you flying\n<pos=1.1em>Charged shots push them off the path"
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'Course 1

    <size=60%>Wind Road</size>'
  - Entrance
  - Entrance
  - "<align=center><size=150%><color=#FF6B5C>Play Together</color></size></align>\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Blow
    the fluff on the center mushroom\n<pos=1.1em>together with everyone\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>The
    fluff moves the same\n<pos=1.1em>on everyone's screen\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>If
    it touches the floor, it pops\n<pos=1.1em>and comes back to the mushroom\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Summon
    your air gun: E key (PC)\n<pos=1.1em>or hold the right stick down (VR)\n<pos=1.1em>Click
    a stand to call it onto the stand\n<size=45%>\n</size><color=#FF6B5C>\u25CF</color><pos=1.1em>Each
    shot uses air (empty = can't shoot)\n<pos=1.1em>Wait or hold to charge to refill"
  - <size=42%>Under construction!</size>
  - 'Course 5

    <size=60%>Mushroom Valley</size>'
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'Air Gun

    <size=60%>Click to summon</size>'
  - Back to Lobby
  - 'Course 0

    <size=60%>Practice Field</size>'
